{x_screens
    {message
        output={@

You check out the screens along the outer wall of the port. They are all
flickering bits of source code and encrypted messages or information across
them. Some of the data appears to be debugging logs... for Shellspace itself!

        }
    }
}

{x_behind_screens
    {message
        output={@

You look behind the screens that are low enough on the wall for you to glimpse
at. Each one has a strange looking cylinder attached to the back of it.
An orange light blinks on each of the cylinders.

        }
    }
}













{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_screens))
    {act, logic=x_screens, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_behind_screens))
    {act, logic=x_behind_screens, tags=!_type|room }
}
